/ActualText (Design Leadership: Mentoring, Design Reviews, Feedback, Quality Assurance\nUX Strategy: UX Roadmap, Product Alignment, Experience Optimization.\nUX Research: User Interviews, Research Planning, Personas, Journey Mapping, Competitive Analysis.\nUX Design: Information Architecture, User Flows, Task Flows, Wireframes, Interaction Design.\nUI Design: High-Fidelity UI, Responsive UI, Mobile UI, Web UI, Visual Design, Layout Systems.\nDesign Systems: Design Standards, Component Library, UI Guidelines, Documentation, Consistency.\nTesting & Iteration: Usability Testing, Insights, Iteration, Data-Informed Design, UX Improvements.\nAccessibility: WCAG, Accessibility Standards, Inclusive Design.\nFront-End Development: Angular, React, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, Component-Based UI Implementation\nResponsive Implementation: Mobile-First, Cross-Browser Support, Pixel-Perfect UI, Layout Alignment, Flexbox, Grid, UI Debugging\nCollaboration: Stakeholder Management, Product Managers, Developers, Presentation and Communication.\nTools: Figma, FigJam, Canva, Photoshop, stitch, Aistudio, claude, VS Code, Github, vercel.)
